      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm having a similar issue with animated physbones not following along parented constraints.\nThe physbones follow constraints fine in Unity but not ingame, there they end up outside. Asked around in the #avatar-dynamics channel and tried many different things but haven't managed to figure out the problem. Enabling/disabling the physbones doesn't refresh them either.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xSvYUmRm_C8",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
