      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Have the same problem. First two pics use a parent constraint to the head followed by a phys bone chain. Very visible offset which produces undesirable results with colliders. Last two pics use the same phys bone chain with a normal armature setup i.e. attached to head. No offset and normal results that match up with Unity play mode testing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
